  </div>

  <!-- NO RESULTS -->
  <div class="no-results" id="noResults">
    <h3>No suppliers found for this combination.</h3>
    <p>Try a different keyword, category or application &mdash; or submit a sourcing request and the PSS team will help you find relevant suppliers.</p>
    <button class="btn-primary" style="padding:13px 32px;font-size:0.9rem;" onclick="clearFilters()" type="button">CLEAR FILTERS</button>
  </div>

</main>

<!-- BUYER SOURCING CTA -->
<section id="sourcing-cta">
  <h2 class="section-title">CAN&rsquo;T FIND THE SUPPLIER YOU NEED?</h2>
  <p class="cta-desc">Tell us what products or sports solutions you are sourcing. The PSS team can help identify relevant exhibitors and suppliers for your needs.</p>
